# DevSecOps Application Deployment Runbook
## GKE + Docker + AWS ECR + Kubernetes

This README covers the phase **after the GCP Terraform infrastructure is running**.

It is written as a practical runbook for this architecture:

```text
Source Code
    |
    v
Docker Build
    |
    v
Security Checks
    |
    v
AWS ECR
    |
    v
Private GKE Nodes
    |
    v
Kubernetes Deployment
    |
    v
Kubernetes Service
    |
    v
Staging Verification
    |
    v
Later: Jenkins -> GitOps Repo -> Argo CD
```

---

