# 6. Step 2 — Build the Image Locally

First verify Docker:

```bash
docker version
```

If your user intentionally does not belong to the Docker group, use:

```bash
sudo docker version
```

Set local variables:

```bash
export APP_NAME="devsecops-webapp"
export IMAGE_TAG="manual-001"
```

Build:

```bash
docker build \
  -t "${APP_NAME}:${IMAGE_TAG}" \
  .
```

If Docker requires sudo:

```bash
sudo docker build \
  -t "${APP_NAME}:${IMAGE_TAG}" \
  .
```

Check the image:

```bash
docker images
```

Inspect:

```bash
docker image inspect "${APP_NAME}:${IMAGE_TAG}"
```

