# 19. Step 13 — Namespaces

Create separate environments.

Example staging namespace:

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Namespace
metadata:
  name: staging
```

Production:

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Namespace
metadata:
  name: production
```

Apply declared manifests:

```bash
kubectl apply -f k8s/namespaces/
```

Or temporarily:

```bash
kubectl create namespace staging
kubectl create namespace production
```

Verify:

```bash
kubectl get namespaces
```

For the final GitOps architecture, namespaces should normally be declared as code rather than created manually.

