# 30. Step 20 — Service Manifest Review

Example:

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: webapp
  namespace: staging

spec:
  selector:
    app: webapp

  ports:
    - port: 80
      targetPort: 8080

  type: ClusterIP
```

Understand the ports:

```text
Client inside cluster
      |
      | port 80
      v
Kubernetes Service
      |
      | targetPort 8080
      v
Application Pod
```

