# 36. Step 25 — Inspect Pod Events

If a Pod fails:

```bash
kubectl describe pod \
  -n staging \
  <POD_NAME>
```

Look near:

```text
Events:
```

Common reasons include:

```text
ImagePullBackOff
ErrImagePull
CrashLoopBackOff
CreateContainerConfigError
FailedScheduling
Readiness probe failed
Liveness probe failed
```

