# 58. Sleeping the GKE Lab

This project has previously used a manual "sleep" process by scaling worker nodes to zero.

Before doing that, remember:

```text
GKE control plane remains
worker compute is removed
```

Do not run application tests while nodes are at zero.

Also remember that manual `gcloud` changes can temporarily create drift from Terraform desired state.

After waking the lab, use:

```bash
